# Agentchat (Server) Environment Variables
#
# apps/server reads shared config from the repo-root .env.convex.local
# directly (Bun --env-file in the dev/start scripts). Create
# apps/server/.env.local only for local-only overrides; anything you set
# in process.env wins.
#
# Variables apps/server consumes (the first three come from .env.convex.local):
#   CONVEX_URL=https://<deployment>.convex.cloud
#   BACKEND_TOKEN_SECRET=<from .env.convex.local>
#   RUNTIME_INGRESS_SECRET=<from .env.convex.local>
#   XDG_STATE_HOME (optional) — set to a per-worktree path if you want
#     concurrent worktrees to keep separate state. Default: ~/.local/state.
#
# apps/server derives the Convex site URL from CONVEX_URL at runtime.
# Portless sets PORT for the server.
